 chats",description:"Heading for the shared chats settings section"},description:{id:"ai-mate.rovo-settings-modal.side-nav-modal.shared-chats.description",defaultMessage:"Manage links to copies of your chats.",description:"Description explaining that the shared chats settings section lets users manage links to shared copies of their chats."},openSharedChatLabel:{id:"ai-mate.rovo-settings-modal.side-nav-modal.shared-chats.open-shared-chat-label",defaultMessage:"Open shared chat: {title}",description:"Accessible label for an icon button that opens a shared chat link. {title} is the shared chat title."},deleteSharedChatLinkLabel:{id:"ai-mate.rovo-settings-modal.side-nav-modal.shared-chats.delete-shared-chat-link-label",defaultMessage:"Delete shared chat link: {title}",description:"Accessible label for an icon button that deletes a shared chat link. {title} is the shared chat title."},truncatedTitle:{id:"ai-mate.rovo-settings-modal.side-nav-modal.shared-chats.truncated-title",defaultMessage:"{titlePrefix}…",description:"Text shown when a shared chat title is shortened to fit in the available row width. {titlePrefix} is the visible beginning of the user-generated shared chat title. Preserve a locale-appropriate truncation marker."},unshareTooltip:{id:"ai-mate.rovo-settings-modal.side-nav-modal.shared-chats.unshare-tooltip",defaultMessage:"Stop sharing",description:"Tooltip shown beside the delete icon button for a shared chat, indicating that the button stops sharing the selected chat link."},accessUpdatedFlagTitle:{id:"rovo-settings-modal.rovo-settings-modal.side-nav-modal-provider.shared-chats-content.accessUpdatedFlagTitle",defaultMessage:"Access updated",description:"Title of the success notification flag shown after access to a shared chat link has been updated."},accessUpdateErrorFlagTitle:{id:"rovo-settings-modal.rovo-settings-modal.side-nav-modal-provider.shared-chats-content.accessUpdateErrorFlagTitle",defaultMessage:"Could not update access",description:"Title 